---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | RM CREATIVES" description="RM CREATIVES privacy policy and information about personal data processing.">
  <main class="legal shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">LEGAL / PRIVACY</div>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="copy">
      <p>RM CREATIVES, SIA respects your privacy and processes personal data only where there is a lawful basis to do so.</p>
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect information you provide directly to us, including your name, email address, phone number, company information and details included in enquiries submitted through our website.</p>
      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <p>We use personal data to respond to enquiries, provide our services, improve our website, perform analytics and, where permitted, communicate relevant information about our services.</p>
      <h2>Data sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell personal data. We may share data with service providers where necessary to operate our website and deliver our services, or where required by law.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Subject to applicable law, you may request access, correction, deletion or restriction of your personal data and may withdraw consent where processing is based on consent.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>RM CREATIVES, SIA<br/>Šarlotes iela 18A - 3, Rīga, LV-1001<br/><a href="mailto:clientcare@rmcreatives.com">clientcare@rmcreatives.com</a></p>
      <p class="note">Last updated: September 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .legal{padding:90px 0 140px}.legal h1{font-size:clamp(58px,9vw,130px);letter-spacing:-.07em;line-height:.9;margin:24px 0 90px;font-weight:600}.copy{max-width:780px;margin-left:auto}.copy h2{font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:48px 0 14px}.copy p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#444;margin:0}.copy a{border-bottom:1px solid currentColor}.note{margin-top:60px!important;color:var(--muted)!important;font-size:13px!important}
</style>
